<p>An elegant alphametic by Jonathan Joseph, from the <a href="https://archive.org/details/Games-Magazine-October-1991-images/page/n61/mode/2up">October 1991</a> issue of <em>Games</em> magazine:</p>
<pre>
   VENUS
    MARS
  SATURN
+ URANUS
--------
 NEPTUNE
</pre>
<p>If each letter consistently represents a particular digit, what equation does this expression encipher?</p>

